Original: "Dark Fantasy: Church of Sin" by Tada_no_ahiru (mods.toml author: bulochka_s_tiltom)
Modrinth project LEQGVg4B (modrinth.com/mod/dark-fantasy-church-of-sin-vanilla), file church_of_sin_Forge_v1.0.jar
(Forge 1.20.1). Its mods.toml declares license="MIT" and its Modrinth page lists the MIT License. The jar ships no
licence text, so the standard MIT text follows.

Used in Jaymo's Powers: its one structure template, as data/jaymospowers/structure/darkened_chapel.nbt (the Darkened
Chapel), changed by tools/church_of_sin_port.py: Forge's leftover data and Supplementaries' items are taken out, a
"Work In Progress" sign is removed, the two written books are rewritten, and its icon paintings are replaced by Jaymo's
Powers' own votive panels. Its worldgen settings (biomes, spacing, terrain) are kept. None of its code or paintings
is used.

